From 69926a9b0dc473e104a4bb29e70426b83f72825c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:40:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(od-sevev): wire the leader walk into the election
 and the pick

The old leader walks off screen-right as the EVOLVE_TX card lifts, before
the flash or the picker; the picked leader walks in from screen-left after
the pick commit, replacing the 250 ms placeholder fade, and Dubi's line
follows the landing. BigBanana._apply_figure is now the one writer of the
figure's position, visibility and alpha: the court yields while a walk runs
and a walk-out cuts a court day home. Reduced motion fades on the mark.
State graph in motion/state-graph-magician.md section 9; tests for pick,
undo, election, the court interplay and reduced motion.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZ6f2h5tcXVKGAwuAga5z8
